unt":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6NpEFQgyQVBfwXNkSuLf0A","review_id":"F_rSRvklqh8QRI8QlXR9PA","date":"2017-01-04T02:15:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9543267488479614,"text_excerpt":"Great new spot! We went yesterday and tried one sweet crepe -- nutella and strawberry -- and one savory crepe -- the hummus crepe, which comes with hummus, spinach, tomato, and we added pesto. Both were delicious! Their menu is quite extensive, and I was especially impressed by all the gluten-free and vegan options they have. Service was fast and friendly, and the woman behind the counter was happy to give us recommendations. Their space is quite large, so you could come here with a group, and they also have WiFi and lots of seating if you want to do work. Will be back!"},{"business_id":"6NpEFQgyQVBfwXNkSuLf0A","review_id":"kCA6gUCBSh9WP2ZbTpEMag","date":"2017-02-28T03:31:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9451339244842529,"text_excerpt":"Fantastic place! Absolutely love crepes, and believe it or not people screw them up quite often. Not here, they hit the nail on the head. From the time you walk through the door you have a cozy welcoming. From the art to the furniture this place has a lot to take it; its beautiful and fun. Greeted by friendly staff they were helpful and patient seeing I couldn't decide. The crepes are whipped up fresh right in front of you on a large grill. The smells fill the building so sweet and savory. The Bacon, spinach, and mozzarella is outta this world. Please try it ; thanks. Also had my first slice of king cake, I can say it wont be my last. Wow so sweet, heavy and cinnamon filled. You can feed ..."},{"business_id":"6NpEFQgyQVBfwXNkSuLf0A","review_id":"a9p4G6tT0hY1TIoPMMkMiQ","date":"2017-01-17T20:39:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9429490566253662,"text_excerpt":"They have the best crepes! I always enjoyed the crepes from their cart in the French Market and was thrilled to hear they were opening an actual cafe in the Bywater. My friend and I finally made it over there to see the place and have lunch. They offer a large menu of both sweet and savory crepes. They also make Vegan crepes as well. You can choose off their menu or customize it how you like. I like the Garden Veggie crepe best, so I usually get that. It was delicious as always. They now offer French Truck coffee too! The people working there are very nice and the atmosphere is fun and colorful. I like all the artwork they have around the place. They are dog friendly as well."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6NpEFQgyQVBfwXNkSuLf0A","photo_id":"bmao0qUf0fYsZ-PhHHuUxA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bmao0qUf0fYsZ-PhHHuUxA.jpg","visual_representativ